B.c77=new A.aI("1. Controller","The operator of CoreActive (coreactive.tr) is the controller of personal data processed on this site and in the application. Information collected through the contact form, account registration, and use of the app is processed for the purposes described below.")
B.c8p=new A.aI("2. Data we collect","Contact form on the product site: name, email, optional company and phone, request type, and message. We may also store browser information (user-agent), language preference, and IP address for security. In-app accounts process identity, membership, tenant data, and operational records (tickets, leave, personnel, documents, meals, reports, and similar) by that company\u2019s administrators and authorized users.")
B.c7r=new A.aI("3. Purpose and legal basis","Contact-form data is processed to answer sales, demo, support, and product requests, to prevent abuse, and to meet legal duties. Application data is processed to perform the contract, for legitimate interests, and other bases under applicable law. Marketing messages are sent only with consent.")
B.c8K=new A.aI("4. Multi-tenant model","CoreActive is multi-tenant software. Each customer company\u2019s data stays in its own tenant. Users of one company cannot access another company\u2019s data. The platform operator may access data only to run the service, for security, or where the law requires it.")
B.c7z=new A.aI("5. Retention and sharing","Contact-form records are kept until the request is closed and legal retention periods expire. Data may be shared with hosting and email providers only as needed to run the service. It is not sold or added to marketing lists except where the law requires disclosure.")
B.c76=new A.aI("6. Cookies and sessions","The signed-in application uses cookies / local storage required for the session. The product site does not use optional tracking cookies. You can clear cookies in your browser; this may sign you out.")
B.c7w=new A.aI("7. Your rights","You may request access, correction, deletion, restriction, or objection under applicable privacy law via the contact form or your registered email. To request deletion of an account and associated data, use coreactive.tr/account-deletion: it covers user accounts and organization (tenant) accounts, and lists deleted versus retained data. For in-app records, your company administrator is also the first contact.")
B.c8k=new A.aI("8. Terms of use","Use the site and app in line with applicable law and the permissions on your account. Unauthorized access, fake requests, disruption of service, or reverse engineering is not allowed. The service is provided as-is. Liability for indirect loss from downtime, maintenance, or third-party outages is limited to the extent permitted by mandatory law.")
B.c75=new A.aI("9. Changes","This notice may be updated. The current version is always published at coreactive.tr/legal. A source draft may be kept in a Google document; the text on this site is the published copy.")
B.brv=s([B.c77,B.c8p,B.c7r,B.c8K,B.c7z,B.c76,B.c7w,B.c8k,B.c75],t.Wy)
